OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Carroll in court over alleged
OL,4,Acontact with ex
OL,5,
OL,6,FFormer England striker Andy Carroll has
OL,7,Fappeared before a judge to face a
OL,8,Fsecond charge of breaching a
OL,9,Fnon-molestation order against his
OL,10,Fex-wife.
OL,12,FThe 37-year-old, who previously played
OL,13,Ffor Newcastle United, Liverpool and
OL,14,FWest Ham, is accused of contacting
OL,15,FBilli Mucklow in Epping, Essex, in
OL,16,FAugust 2025.
OL,18,FHe has already denied making repeated
OL,19,Fmobile phone and FaceTime Audio calls
OL,20,Fto Mucklow in March of that year.
OL,23,APub: 09-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
