OL,3,GNEWSAAndy Carroll in court over alleged
OL,4,Acontact with ex
OL,5,
OL,6,FCarroll also pleaded not guilty to the
OL,7,Fmost recent offence and is due to stand
OL,8,Ftrial at Chelmsford Crown Court in
OL,9,FJanuary. He appeared at the latest
OL,10,Fhearing via video link.
